Package: thinkthen
Type: Package
Title: The ThinkThen Verbs for R
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R: person("Ian", "Maurer", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "imaurer@gmail.com")
Description: One engine under ten surfaces: the eight verbs (decide,
    choose, score, tag, filter, rank, find, annotate) plus recognize and
    relate, with a tt_ prefix. A column goes in and a column comes out.
    NA is "not sure". A bulk call crosses into the engine once and runs
    at the engine's width. A recognized name carries its strength: a
    number the tool computes, the least of the word probabilities times
    the mean of the kind probabilities. Errors carry one of six kinds
    and a retry signal.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends:
    R (>= 4.2)
Imports:
    jsonlite
Suggests:
    dplyr
Config/rextendr:
    version = 0.5.0
SystemRequirements: Cargo, rustc
RoxygenNote: 7.3.1
